---
title: Web UI - Component Architecture (Phase 1)
---
graph TD
    subgraph WEBUI["Web UI <br/><i>React + TypeScript</i>"]
        subgraph UI["UI Components"]
            SHELL[App Shell<br/><i>Root layout</i><br/>Sidebar + main panel split]
            CHAT[Chat Panel<br/><i>Sidebar</i><br/>Message list, text input]
            CONTENT[Content Panel<br/><i>Main panel</i><br/>Renders selected artifact]
            MD[Markdown Renderer<br/>Markdown to HTML]
            MMD[Mermaid Renderer<br/>MMD to SVG]
        end

        subgraph INFRA["Infrastructure Components"]
            WS[WebSocket Client<br/>Chat API connection]
            HTTP[Artifact Client<br/>Artifact API fetch]
            STORE[Session Store<br/>Session, messages, selection]
        end
    end

    subgraph SERVER["Local Server"]
        CHAT_API[Chat API<br/><i>WebSocket</i>]
        ART_API[Artifact API<br/><i>HTTP GET</i>]
    end

    CHAT -->|Sends user message| WS
    WS -->|Streams assistant response| CHAT
    CHAT -->|Writes selected artifact ref| STORE
    CHAT -->|Reads/writes messages| STORE
    CONTENT -->|Reads selected artifact| STORE
    CONTENT -->|Fetches artifact content| HTTP
    CONTENT -->|Delegates .md| MD
    CONTENT -->|Delegates .mmd| MMD
    WS -->|Chat, streaming; WS| CHAT_API
    HTTP -->|Fetch artifact; HTTP GET| ART_API
